#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 261
#: rc.cpp:171
msgid "This script is sourced by gdb when the debugging starts."
msgstr "Este script é usado como fonte por gdb cando comeza a depuración."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 271
#: rc.cpp:174
msgctxt "Shell script to be executed at run time"
msgid "R&un shell script:"
msgstr "Executar o script de &shell:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 284
#: rc.cpp:177
msgid "Script to start remote application"
msgstr "Script para iniciar o programa remoto"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 293
#: rc.cpp:180
msgid ""
"This shell script is run after the Config gdb script has been sourced by "
"gdb.\n"
"When debugging remotely this script is intended to actually start the remote "
"process.\n"
"[It is expected that the debug executable can be reached on the target, "
"maybe by downloading it as a final build step]\n"
"1) Find a way to execute a command remotely - rsh, ssh, telnet, ...\n"
"2a) Execute \"gdbserver ... application\" on target.\n"
"or if your executable contains the gdb stub\n"
"2b) Execute \"application\" on target."
msgstr ""
"Este script de shell é executado tras que gdb orixine o script de "
"configuración de gdb.\n"
"Cando se depura de xeito remoto este script serve para iniciar o proceso "
"remoto.\n"
"[Agárdase que o executábel depurador poda ser acedido no obxectivo, "
"posibelmente obténdoo como etapa final da construción]\n"
"1) Atope un xeito de executar un comando remotamente - rsh, ssh, "
"telnet, ...\n"
"2a) Execute \"gdbserver ... programa\" no obxectivo.\n"
"ou se o seu executábel contén a matriz de gdb.\n"
"2b) Execute \"programa\" no obxectivo."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 300
#: rc.cpp:189
msgctxt "Gdb script to be executed at run time."
msgid "Run &gdb script:"
msgstr "Executar o script de &gdb:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 313
#: rc.cpp:192
msgid "Script to connect with remote application"
msgstr "O script para conectar cun programa remoto"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file ./languages/cpp/debugger/debuggerconfigwidget.ui line 320
#: rc.cpp:195
msgid ""
"This script is sourced by gdb after the two preceding scripts have been "
"executed.\n"
"This script is intended for the actual commands needed to connect to a "
"remotely running executable.\n"
"\tshell sleep 5\twait for remote program to start\n"
"\ttarget remote ...\tconnect to the remote debugger\n"
"\tcontinue\t[optional] run debugging to the first breakpoint."
msgstr ""
"Este script é tomado como fonte por gdb tras executar os dous scripts "
"precedentes.\n"
"O propósito deste script é conter or comandos reais precisos para conectar "
"cun executábel remoto.\n"
"\tshell sleep 5\tagarda o inicio do programa remoto\n"
"\ttarget remote ...\tconecta co depurador remoto\n"
"\tcontinue\t[opcional] executa a depuración até o primeiro ponto de parada."

